OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby hospital could have
OL,4,Aprevented some baby deaths, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deaths of some babies at the
OL,8,Fhospital where killer nurse Lucy Letby
OL,9,Fworked could have been prevented, an
OL,10,Finquiry finds
OL,12,FChair Lady Justice Thirlwall says there
OL,13,Fwas a "complete failure to protect
OL,14,Fbabies" at the Countess of Chester
OL,15,FHospital, blaming safeguarding failures
OL,16,Fand "dysfunctional management" - key
OL,17,Ftakeaways from the report
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
