OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby hospital could have
OL,4,Aprevented some baby deaths, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe hospital's executives "failed in
OL,8,Fthe duty of candour with parents,
OL,9,Finvestigators and regulators". Tony
OL,10,FChambers - who resigned as the trust's
OL,11,Fchief in 2018 - had a "dictatorial"
OL,12,Fmanner, the report says
OL,14,FAmong Thirlwall's recommendations are
OL,15,FCCTV for all cots and incubators in
OL,16,Fneonatal units, plus restricting access
OL,17,Fto insulin and creating a panel of
OL,18,Fexperts for when concerns are raised
OL,19,Fabout harm to patients
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
